    "excerpt": "This bot is designed for Spot, \u2026 opens operations when the 4H RSI is above 55% and below 70%. \u2026 and the price action above the 200 EMA. \u2026 The TP is an ATR but it could be by % or by SAR. \u2026 This bot does not use SL but it could be an RSI above 70%. \u2026 In BTC it has a very good performance, but if you want it can work with other currencies as well",
